"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d choose the earlier-arriving Aeroplan award if you can use more points: it arrives 10h 20m earlier than the other award shown and has the shorter reported elapsed time. The tradeoff is its higher points requirement. These are selected search results, not the full eligible inventory, and some results may not be real-time.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J12@2027-01-15T14:40-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T06:30\",\"n\":\"Earlier Aeroplan award via Vancouver\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO Jan 15 at 2:40 p.m. and arrives at BKK Jan 17 at 6:30 a.m.; the reported elapsed time is 24h 50m. The economy award is on AC via YVR, with a 6h 15m connection, and shows 9 seats. It requires 92,144 Aeroplan points and reports CAD 43.90 in taxes; the quote scope is unknown, so that amount cannot be assumed to be per traveler or all-in. The main downside versus the other award shown is the higher points requirement. The award cabin is reported as economy, but cabin details for each leg are absent.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T02\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T03\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J13@2027-01-15T23:30-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T16:50\",\"n\":\"Lower-points Aeroplan award via Taipei\",\"v\":\"This option departs SFO Jan 15 at 11:30 p.m. and arrives Jan 17 at 4:50 p.m. It is an economy award on BR and TG via TPE, with an 8h 15m connection, and shows 1 seat. At 65,000 Aeroplan points, it uses fewer points than the recommended award, but arrives later and has a longer reported elapsed time. It reports CAD 116.50 in taxes; as with the other award, the quote scope is unknown, so it is not a confirmed per-traveler or all-in amount. Cabin details for each leg are absent.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-15T09:40-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline via Singapore\",\"v\":\"The cash result departs SFO Jan 15 at 9:40 a.m. and arrives Jan 17 at 8:25 a.m., with one stop via SIN on Singapore Airlines. It reports USD 440, but the quote scope is unknown; treat this as a separate cash reference, not a confirmed per-traveler or all-in total or a directly comparable total cost to either award. It has a longer reported elapsed time than either award shown.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The award connection waits are reported airport waits; the results do not establish ticket protection or bookability. Confirm current award availability and prices with the booking provider before making plans. The search results also report partial coverage, so these choices should not be read as exhaustive.\"}]}"
